# Production security scan policy.
#
# `just audit-code-security` scans every package under `src/` with Semgrep's
# stock security rules. Keep that lane focused on production source. Mirrored
# legal data, tests, and explicit test-support files are audited through
# separate provenance, redaction, fixture, and test-hygiene gates instead of
# the stock security lane. Production findings must be fixed in source or
# justified at the exact audited line; do not add production-source exclusions
# here to force a green scan.

# Mirrored AEAT/BOE/legal corpus and generated registry data.
src/**/_data/

# Tests and test-support packages.
src/**/test_*.py
src/**/_test_*.py
src/**/tests/
src/**/conftest.py

# Test-only support modules whose names intentionally avoid pytest collection.
